@API_BancoFisclase_HostAddress = https://localhost:5001

### Health / Swagger
GET {{API_BancoFisclase_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html
Accept: text/html

###

### Get estadisticas generales
GET {{API_BancoFisclase_HostAddress}}/api/banco/estadisticas
Accept: application/json

###

### Get movimientos del dia
GET {{API_BancoFisclase_HostAddress}}/api/banco/movimientos-del-dia
Accept: application/json

###

### Admin login (replace credentials)
POST {{API_BancoFisclase_HostAddress}}/api/banco/login-admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Username": "admin",
  "Password": "yourPasswordHere"
}

###

### Ejecutar resúmenes diarios (requires admin, no body)
POST {{API_BancoFisclase_HostAddress}}/api/banco/ejecutar-resumenes
Accept: application/json

###